{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粵艇南下即日實施，政府首航儀式後見記者，運輸及物流局局長陳美寶交代首天運作情況，表示到訪的遊艇行程安排豐富，更有上岸行程，亦會多推廣香港旅遊攻略。海事處培訓課程有約2,700名船長參與，相信粵艇南下能帶動經濟發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T06:19:47.532459+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:18:05.795932+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:40.887840+00:00","content_hash":"6fcafcb5df57d111a9b9caaa296431b7da8cccdd0d30b55a8be34a17a87ea041","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}